configure terminal
firewall
service name FWS_tcp_80 proto tcp src all dst port 80
service name FWS_tcp_443 proto tcp src all dst port 443
service name FWS_udp-53 proto udp src all dst port 53
service name FWS_tcp-53 proto tcp src all dst port 53
service name FWS_tcp-8443 proto tcp src all dst port 8443
