ipv4rule from eth2 to eth0 srcip 0.0.0.0/0 dstip 11.0.0.0-255.255.255.255 action acc service FWS_tcp_80 log no prior 4
ipv4rule from eth2 to eth0 srcip 0.0.0.0/0 dstip 11.0.0.0-255.255.255.255 action acc service FWS_tcp_443 log no prior 4
ipv4rule from eth1 to eth2 srcip 0.0.0.0/0 dstip 0.0.0.0/0 action acc service FWS_icmp-8 log no prior 4
